cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AgriSecure-AI: Phase 1 threat model, labelled J1939 dataset and baseline detection"
authors:
  - family-names: Algharibeh
    given-names: Moath
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
repository-code: "https://github.com/algharibeh/AgriSecure-AI"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - CAN bus
  - SAE J1939
  - ISOBUS
  - intrusion detection
  - agricultural machinery
  - cybersecurity
  - dataset
abstract: >-
  Phase 1 of AgriSecure-AI: an ISO/SAE 21434-style threat model of a tractor
  J1939 / ISOBUS network, a labelled dataset built by reconstructing a J1939
  frame stream from real tractor signals and injecting seeded, simulated
  anomaly scenarios, and a rule-based and Isolation Forest baseline evaluated
  on held-out attacked fields. The dataset is released under CC BY 4.0 and is
  derived from the Tümosan 81.110 P tractor recordings on Mendeley Data
  (DOI 10.17632/bbjtjrsxvx.2, CC BY 4.0); the code is MIT-licensed.
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Tümosan 81.110 P tractor soil-tillage CAN/J1939 recordings"
    doi: 10.17632/bbjtjrsxvx.2
    repository: "https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/bbjtjrsxvx/2"
    license: CC-BY-4.0
